    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG GLEN CORCORAN are delighted to bring to the market, 'Stoneyisland Cottage', an excellent waterfront property located on the shores of Lough Derg. Set on a private site c. 1.25 acres, only 5.5km from the Shannonside town of Portumna, this unique property offers a wonderful opportunity for those seeking a little piece of paradise in the heart of Ireland\r\n\r\nInternally, accommodation extends to c. 127 sq.m and includes Entrance Hall, Living/Dining Room, Kitchen, 3 Bedrooms & 2 Shower Rooms. Externally, the property has the benefit of a mature wooded site, tarmacadam driveway and an extensive concrete pier fronting onto the lake. This pier extends into a large boathouse allowing for secure sheltered mooring of boats etc. A concrete jetty extends out towards the lake leaving a safe sheltered haven on the lake shore. An elevated timber decking area offers an excellent outside space for entertaining and dining 'Al Fresco'\r\n\r\nThis exceptional property is a must see for anyone with an interest in boating, fishing or just watching the world go by on the slow waters of Lough Derg. The property is very accessible with Galway c. 1hr 10mins, Dublin c. 2hr 25 mins & Shannon Airport c. 1hr 20mins. Locally, the town of Portumna is c. 5.5km from the property and has both primary & secondary schools, bars, restaurants, supermarkets etc. \r\n\r\nViewing of 'Stoneyisland Cottage' is highly recommended through Sole Selling Agents DNG GLEN CORCORAN"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: (2.10m x 2.44m)\r\n\r\nKitchen: (4.00m x 1.79m)\r\nGood selection of wall & base units, tiles to floors and tiled splashback\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Room: (6.78m x 6.07m)\r\nExcellent light filled heart of the home. Comes with feature windows overlooking the lake with direct access to the exterior, semi solid oak flooring, vaulted sheeted timber ceilings and open fireplace\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: (4.78m x 4.19m)\r\nLarge Double Bedroom with laminated timber floors, sheeted timber ceilings, built in wardrobes and large window and door overlooking the lake\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: (4.83m x 3.94m)\r\nLarge Double Bedroom with solid timber floors, sheeted timber ceilings, built in wardrobes and large window and door overlooking the lake\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: (4.40m x 3.13m)\r\nLarge Double Bedroom with laminated timber floors, sheeted timber ceilings & walls, built in wardrobes and large window and door leading to the exterior\r\n\r\nShower Room 1: (2.26m x 2.09m)\r\nSpacious shower room with WC, Vanity Unit, Shower Enclosure, Tiled Floors and Timber Panelling to Walls\r\n\r\nShower Room 2: (2.50m x 1.53m)\r\nSpacious shower room with WC, WHB, Shower Enclosure, Tiled Floors and Fully Tiled Walls"
      },
